        <pubDate>Fri, 24 Oct 2025 21:52:18 +0800</pubDate>
        <description><![CDATA[
<div class="one-in-seq-wrapper">
    <div class="one-in-seq asset-info-line"><a target="_blank" class="secondary" href="/SlipBox">SlipBox</a> / <a href="/SlipBox/2025-10-24_21.52.18">2025-10-24_21.52.18</a> <span>2025-10-24 21:52:18 UTC+8</span></div>
</div>

      
          <div class="group-asset"><div class="one-in-seq-wrapper">
    <div class="one-in-seq principal-content">
<div class="lang-wrapper" lang="zh-Hans"><p>现在浏览器御二家对于简体中文的字体fallback依然是狗屎。证据：</p>
<ul>
<li><code>font.name-list.monospace.zh-CN</code> is <code>NSimSun, SimSun, MS Song, SimSun-ExtB</code> by default on ff</li>
<li><a href="https://issues.chromium.org/issues/41104519" target="_blank">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/41104519</a></li>
</ul>
<p>所以本站所有<code>lang=&quot;zh-Hans&quot;</code>下的monospace内容仍然是宋体，没有任何设置可供调整，唯一调整办法是用<a href="/styleCustomizer" target="_blank">/styleCustomizer</a>或者UserScript或者UserStyle自定义页面样式。</p>


</div>
</div>
</div>

          </div>
      <div class="one-in-seq-wrapper">
    <div class="one-in-seq asset-info-line"><div class="ref-marker">&gt;&gt;&gt;</div> <a target="_blank" class="secondary" href="/SlipBox">SlipBox</a> / <a href="/SlipBox/2025-10-19_22.41.33">2025-10-19_22.41.33</a> <span>2025-10-19 22:41:33 UTC+8</span></div>
    <div class="one-in-seq principal-content">
<div class="lang-wrapper" lang="zh-Hans"><p>浏览器里给了一句<code>font-family: monospace</code>，结果它的字体还和当前节点所属的lang有关？是中文直接变宋体，忽略浏览器设置？？</p>


</div>
</div>
</div>

        ]]></description>
